'Start at 0.5. Keep 90%: 0.5 × 0.9 = 0.45. Keep 90% again: 0.45 × 0.9 = 0.405. No input, no threshold crossing.',
[r'v_{t+1}=\beta v_t',r'\beta=0.9\quad\Rightarrow\quad 1-\beta=0.1'],
