'r = 20, θ = 1. Readings 20.3, 20.6, 20.9 produce no event. At 21.2 send UP; update r to 21, leaving a 0.2 residual. We allow one event per reading here.',
[r'\Delta=x-r',r'r\leftarrow r+\theta\quad\text{on UP}',r'r\leftarrow r-\theta\quad\text{on DOWN}'],
